WEBVTT

00:00:29.224 --> 00:00:32.450
most people will say things like,
"I feel anxious."

00:00:32.474 --> 00:00:35.200
And so the insecurities come.
The shame comes.

00:00:35.224 --> 00:00:37.784
I think we have a fraught
relationship with money,

00:00:37.808 --> 00:00:39.909
because it comes with judgment.

00:00:39.933 --> 00:00:42.950
When you're not able
to pay your bills on time,

00:00:42.974 --> 00:00:44.242
you can personalize that.

00:00:44.266 --> 00:00:46.700
I don't want anyone to think
that I'm not smart.

00:00:46.724 --> 00:00:50.325
I don't want anyone to know
that I am very insecure with money.

00:00:50.349 --> 00:00:53.367
I don't want anyone to know
that I am super stressed out.

00:00:53.391 --> 00:00:55.534
So now let's change the narrative.

00:00:55.558 --> 00:00:59.950
[6 lessons on how to improve
our relationship with money]

00:00:59.974 --> 00:01:02.367
[1: Talk about it.]